OL,3,GNEWSA'Extensive record' of Corby life
OL,4,Ato be digitised
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchive images collected of a
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire town for almost 45
OL,8,Fyears are to be digitised and made
OL,9,Favailable online.
OL,11,FCorby Community Arts has created and
OL,12,Faccumulated an "extensive record of
OL,13,FCorby's social and cultural life, as
OL,14,Fwell as the many changes to the
OL,15,Fphysical environment" since it was
OL,16,Fdesignated a New Town in 1950.
OL,18,FA special archive exhibition will take
OL,19,Fplace on Saturday and Sunday that will
OL,20,Finclude larger scale versions of some
OL,21,Fimages on the site and others that have
OL,22,Fyet to be digitised.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
